r the same engagement."}],["$","p","1",{"children":"Engagement scale varies deliberately by design — a single-site RF survey and a multi-market fibre rollout are both handled within the same program structure, sized to the requirement rather than forced into a one-size proposal. A general contractor managing a larger build can bring TechnoKraft in for a specific stage — RF design, or fibre construction alone — without taking on the full survey-to-optimisation scope, just as a carrier planning a full market launch can engage the complete lifecycle under one program."}]]}]]}]}]
